{"authored" [] "sources" [{"question" "q-114293" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Calculate $\\int (3x-4){e}^{-3x}\\,\\text{d}x.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14009414/state.json" "file_sha256" "ce85a2ec91b813e6cec4f0e2f39754284cb45f687a6237829f98790ba59052f7"} {"question" "q-114293" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "To solve this integral, we use the by-parts formula, given by\n\n$$\n\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x=uv-\\int v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nWe need to express $\\int (3x-4){e}^{-3x}\\text{d}x$ as $\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x.$ Therefore, we set\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u=3x-4\\, & ⟹\\,{u}^{′}=3 \\\\ {v}^{′}={e}^{-3x}\\, & ⟹\\,v=-\\frac{{e}^{-3x}}{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe substitute the above into the integration by parts formula, and we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x & =uv-\\int v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int (3x-4)\\cdot {e}^{-3x}\\,\\text{d}x & =(3x-4)\\cdot (-\\frac{{e}^{-3x}}{3})-\\int (-\\frac{{e}^{-3x}}{3})\\cdot 3\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we calculate the integral, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int (3x-4){e}^{-3x}\\,\\text{d}x & =-\\frac{(3x-4){e}^{-3x}}{3}+\\int {e}^{-3x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-\\frac{(3x-4){e}^{-3x}}{3}-\\frac{{e}^{-3x}}{3}+C \\\\  & =-\\frac{(3x-3){e}^{-3x}}{3}+C \\\\  & =(1-x){e}^{-3x}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14009414/state.json" "file_sha256" "ce85a2ec91b813e6cec4f0e2f39754284cb45f687a6237829f98790ba59052f7"} {"question" "q-114293" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/hard "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14009414/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "2405a0d59b762ca246d05602433b2bd1e5d035f108323f2b9b81df964df831d5"} {"question" "q-114293" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14009414/state.json" "file_sha256" "ce85a2ec91b813e6cec4f0e2f39754284cb45f687a6237829f98790ba59052f7"} {"question" "q-114293" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "(1-x){e}^{-3x}+C"] ["math" "(2-3x){e}^{-3x}+C"] ["math" "(2x-1){e}^{-3x}+C"] ["math" "\\frac{(2-x){e}^{-3x}}{3}+C"] ["math" "\\frac{(2x-1){e}^{-3x}}{3}+C"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14009414/state.json" "file_sha256" "ce85a2ec91b813e6cec4f0e2f39754284cb45f687a6237829f98790ba59052f7"} {"question" "q-114293" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "(1-x){e}^{-3x}+C"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14009414/state.json" "file_sha256" "ce85a2ec91b813e6cec4f0e2f39754284cb45f687a6237829f98790ba59052f7"} {"question" "q-114288" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "$\\int 4x{e}^{8x}\\,\\text{d}x=$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14009414/state.json" "file_sha256" "ce85a2ec91b813e6cec4f0e2f39754284cb45f687a6237829f98790ba59052f7"} {"question" "q-114288" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "To solve this integral, we use the by-parts formula, given by\n\n$$\n\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x=uv-\\int v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nWe need to express $\\int 4x{e}^{8x}\\text{d}x$ as $\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x.$ Therefore, we set\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u=4x\\, & ⟹\\,{u}^{′}=4 \\\\ {v}^{′}={e}^{8x}\\, & ⟹\\,v=\\frac{1}{8}{e}^{8x}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe substitute the above into the integration by parts formula, and we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x & =uv-\\int v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int 4x\\cdot {e}^{8x}\\,\\text{d}x & =4x\\cdot \\frac{1}{8}{e}^{8x}-\\int \\frac{1}{8}{e}^{8x}\\cdot 4\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we calculate the integral, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int 4x{e}^{8x}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\frac{1}{2}x{e}^{8x}-\\frac{1}{2}\\int {e}^{8x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{x{e}^{8x}}{2}-\\frac{{e}^{8x}}{16}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14009414/state.json" "file_sha256" "ce85a2ec91b813e6cec4f0e2f39754284cb45f687a6237829f98790ba59052f7"} {"question" "q-114288" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14009414/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "2405a0d59b762ca246d05602433b2bd1e5d035f108323f2b9b81df964df831d5"} {"question" "q-114288" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14009414/state.json" "file_sha256" "ce85a2ec91b813e6cec4f0e2f39754284cb45f687a6237829f98790ba59052f7"} {"question" "q-114288" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "\\frac{3x{e}^{8x}}{8}+\\frac{{e}^{8x}}{12}+C"] ["math" "\\frac{x{e}^{8x}}{2}-\\frac{{e}^{8x}}{16}+C"] ["math" "\\frac{x{e}^{8x}}{2}-\\frac{{e}^{8x}}{4}+C"] ["math" "\\frac{x{e}^{8x}}{4}+\\frac{5{e}^{8x}}{16}+C"] ["math" "\\frac{x{e}^{8x}}{8}-\\frac{{e}^{8x}}{16}+C"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14009414/state.json" "file_sha256" "ce85a2ec91b813e6cec4f0e2f39754284cb45f687a6237829f98790ba59052f7"} {"question" "q-114288" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\frac{x{e}^{8x}}{2}-\\frac{{e}^{8x}}{16}+C"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14009414/state.json" "file_sha256" "ce85a2ec91b813e6cec4f0e2f39754284cb45f687a6237829f98790ba59052f7"} {"question" "q-2420" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "$\\int x{5}^{x}\\,\\text{d}x=$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14009414/state.json" "file_sha256" "ce85a2ec91b813e6cec4f0e2f39754284cb45f687a6237829f98790ba59052f7"} {"question" "q-2420" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "To solve this integral, we use the by-parts formula, given by\n\n$$\n\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x=uv-\\int v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nWe need to express $\\int x{5}^{x}\\text{d}x$ as $\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x.$ Therefore, we set\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u=x\\, & ⟹\\,{u}^{′}=1 \\\\ {v}^{′}={5}^{x}\\, & ⟹\\,v=\\frac{{5}^{x}}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡(5)}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe substitute the above into the integration by parts formula, and we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x & =uv-\\int v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int x\\cdot {5}^{x}\\,\\text{d}x & =x\\cdot \\frac{{5}^{x}}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡(5)}-\\int \\frac{{5}^{x}}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡(5)}\\cdot 1\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we calculate the integral, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int x{5}^{x}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\frac{x{5}^{x}}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡(5)}-\\int \\frac{{5}^{x}}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡(5)}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{x{5}^{x}}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡(5)}-\\frac{{5}^{x}}{(\\operatorname{ln}⁡(5))^{2}}+C \\\\  & =\\frac{{5}^{x}}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡5}(x-\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡5})+C\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14009414/state.json" "file_sha256" "ce85a2ec91b813e6cec4f0e2f39754284cb45f687a6237829f98790ba59052f7"} {"question" "q-2420" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14009414/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "2405a0d59b762ca246d05602433b2bd1e5d035f108323f2b9b81df964df831d5"} {"question" "q-2420" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14009414/state.json" "file_sha256" "ce85a2ec91b813e6cec4f0e2f39754284cb45f687a6237829f98790ba59052f7"} {"question" "q-2420" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "\\frac{{5}^{x}}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡5}(1-\\frac{x}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡5})+C"] ["math" "\\frac{{5}^{x}}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡5}(\\frac{1}{x}-\\frac{x}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡5})+C"] ["math" "\\frac{{5}^{x}}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡5}(x+\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡5})+C"] ["math" "\\frac{{5}^{x}}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡5}(x-1)+C"] ["math" "\\frac{{5}^{x}}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡5}(x-\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡5})+C"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14009414/state.json" "file_sha256" "ce85a2ec91b813e6cec4f0e2f39754284cb45f687a6237829f98790ba59052f7"} {"question" "q-2420" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\frac{{5}^{x}}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡5}(x-\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡5})+C"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14009414/state.json" "file_sha256" "ce85a2ec91b813e6cec4f0e2f39754284cb45f687a6237829f98790ba59052f7"} {"question" "q-12560" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Calculate the integral $\\int (x+7){e}^{2x+5}\\,\\text{d}x.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14009414/state.json" "file_sha256" "ce85a2ec91b813e6cec4f0e2f39754284cb45f687a6237829f98790ba59052f7"} {"question" "q-12560" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "To solve this integral, we use the by-parts formula, given by\n\n$$\n\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x=uv-\\int v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nWe need to express $\\int (x+7){e}^{2x+5}\\,\\text{d}x$ as $\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x.$ Therefore, we set\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u=x+7\\, & ⟹\\,{u}^{′}=1 \\\\ {v}^{′}={e}^{2x+5}\\, & ⟹\\,v=\\frac{{e}^{2x+5}}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe substitute the above into the integration by parts formula, and we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x & =uv-\\int v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int (x+7)\\cdot {e}^{2x+5}\\,\\text{d}x & =(x+7)\\cdot \\frac{{e}^{2x+5}}{2}-\\int \\frac{{e}^{2x+5}}{2}\\cdot 1\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we calculate the integral, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int (x+7){e}^{2x+5}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\frac{(x+7){e}^{2x+5}}{2}-\\frac{1}{2}\\int {e}^{2x+5}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{(x+7){e}^{2x+5}}{2}-\\frac{{e}^{2x+5}}{4}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14009414/state.json" "file_sha256" "ce85a2ec91b813e6cec4f0e2f39754284cb45f687a6237829f98790ba59052f7"} {"question" "q-12560" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/hard "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14009414/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "2405a0d59b762ca246d05602433b2bd1e5d035f108323f2b9b81df964df831d5"} {"question" "q-12560" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14009414/state.json" "file_sha256" "ce85a2ec91b813e6cec4f0e2f39754284cb45f687a6237829f98790ba59052f7"} {"question" "q-12560" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "-\\frac{(x+7){e}^{2x+5}}{4}+\\frac{{e}^{2x+5}}{2}+C"] ["math" "-\\frac{x{e}^{2x+5}}{4}+\\frac{{e}^{2x+5}}{2}+C"] ["math" "\\frac{(x+7){e}^{2x+5}}{2}-\\frac{{e}^{2x+5}}{4}+C"] ["math" "\\frac{(x+7){e}^{2x+5}}{4}-\\frac{x{e}^{2x+5}}{4}+C"] ["math" "\\frac{x{e}^{2x+5}}{4}-\\frac{{e}^{2x+5}}{4}+C"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14009414/state.json" "file_sha256" "ce85a2ec91b813e6cec4f0e2f39754284cb45f687a6237829f98790ba59052f7"} {"question" "q-12560" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\frac{(x+7){e}^{2x+5}}{2}-\\frac{{e}^{2x+5}}{4}+C"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14009414/state.json" "file_sha256" "ce85a2ec91b813e6cec4f0e2f39754284cb45f687a6237829f98790ba59052f7"} {"question" "q-114287" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Calculate $\\int 6x{e}^{-3x}\\,\\text{d}x.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14009414/state.json" "file_sha256" "ce85a2ec91b813e6cec4f0e2f39754284cb45f687a6237829f98790ba59052f7"} {"question" "q-114287" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "To solve this integral, we use the by-parts formula, given by\n\n$$\n\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x=uv-\\int v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nWe need to express $\\int 6x{e}^{-3x}\\text{d}x$ as $\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x.$ Therefore, we set\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u=6x\\, & ⟹\\,{u}^{′}=6 \\\\ {v}^{′}={e}^{-3x}\\, & ⟹\\,v=-\\frac{{e}^{-3x}}{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe, substitute the above into the integration by parts formula, and we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x & =uv-\\int v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int 6x\\cdot {e}^{-3x}\\,\\text{d}x & =6x\\cdot (-\\frac{{e}^{-3x}}{3})-\\int (-\\frac{{e}^{-3x}}{3})\\cdot 6\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-2x{e}^{-3x}+2\\int {e}^{-3x}\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we calculate the integral, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int 6x{e}^{-3x}\\,\\text{d}x & =-2x{e}^{-3x}+2\\int {e}^{-3x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-2x{e}^{-3x}-\\frac{2{e}^{-3x}}{3}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14009414/state.json" "file_sha256" "ce85a2ec91b813e6cec4f0e2f39754284cb45f687a6237829f98790ba59052f7"} {"question" "q-114287" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14009414/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "2405a0d59b762ca246d05602433b2bd1e5d035f108323f2b9b81df964df831d5"} {"question" "q-114287" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14009414/state.json" "file_sha256" "ce85a2ec91b813e6cec4f0e2f39754284cb45f687a6237829f98790ba59052f7"} {"question" "q-114287" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "-2x{e}^{-3x}-\\frac{2{e}^{-3x}}{3}+C"] ["math" "-3x{e}^{-3x}-\\frac{{e}^{-3x}}{3}+C"] ["math" "-x{e}^{-3x}+\\frac{2{e}^{-3x}}{3}+C"] ["math" "4x{e}^{-3x}-\\frac{3{e}^{-3x}}{2}+C"] ["math" "\\frac{x{e}^{-3x}}{2}-\\frac{2{e}^{-3x}}{3}+C"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14009414/state.json" "file_sha256" "ce85a2ec91b813e6cec4f0e2f39754284cb45f687a6237829f98790ba59052f7"} {"question" "q-114287" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "-2x{e}^{-3x}-\\frac{2{e}^{-3x}}{3}+C"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14009414/state.json" "file_sha256" "ce85a2ec91b813e6cec4f0e2f39754284cb45f687a6237829f98790ba59052f7"} {"question" "q-14453" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "$\\int 6x\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x)\\,\\text{d}x=$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14009414/state.json" "file_sha256" "ce85a2ec91b813e6cec4f0e2f39754284cb45f687a6237829f98790ba59052f7"} {"question" "q-14453" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "To solve this integral, we use the by-parts formula, given by\n\n$$\n\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x=uv-\\int v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nWe need to express $\\int 6x\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x)\\text{d}x$ as $\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x.$ Therefore, we set\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u=6x\\, & ⟹\\,{u}^{′}=6 \\\\ {v}^{′}=\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x)\\, & ⟹\\,v=\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe substitute the above into the integration by parts formula, and we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x & =uv-\\int v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int 6x\\cdot \\operatorname{cos}⁡(x)\\,\\text{d}x & =6x\\cdot \\operatorname{sin}⁡(x)-\\int \\operatorname{sin}⁡(x)\\cdot 6\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we calculate the integral, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int 6x\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x)\\,\\text{d}x & =6x\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x)-6\\int \\operatorname{sin}⁡(x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =6x\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x)-6(-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x))+C \\\\  & =6x\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x)+6\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x)+C\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14009414/state.json" "file_sha256" "ce85a2ec91b813e6cec4f0e2f39754284cb45f687a6237829f98790ba59052f7"} {"question" "q-14453" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14009414/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "2405a0d59b762ca246d05602433b2bd1e5