re, we set\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u=10x\\, & ⟹\\,{u}^{′}=10 \\\\ {v}^{′}=\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x)\\, & ⟹\\,v=\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe substitute the above into the integration by parts formula, and we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x & =uv-\\int v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int 10x\\cdot \\operatorname{cos}⁡(x)\\,\\text{d}x & =10x\\cdot (\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x))-\\int (\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x))\\cdot 10\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we calculate the integral, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int 10x\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x)\\,\\text{d}x & =10x\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x)-10\\int \\operatorname{sin}⁡(x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =10x\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x)+10\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x)+C\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14009414/state.json" "file_sha256" "ce85a2ec91b813e6cec4f0e2f39754284cb45f687a6237829f98790ba59052f7"} {"question" "q-74090" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14009414/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "2405a0d59b762ca246d05602433b2bd1e5d035f108323f2b9b81df964df831d5"} {"question" "q-74090" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14009414/state.json" "file_sha256" "ce85a2ec91b813e6cec4f0e2f39754284cb45f687a6237829f98790ba59052f7"} {"question" "q-74090" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "10\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x)-10x\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x)+C"] ["math" "10\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x)-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x)+C"] ["math" "10x\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x)+10\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x)+C"] ["math" "10x\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x)+\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x)}{10}+C"] ["math" "\\frac{x\\operatorname{